  "endingVerification": "At Ramp the story reports “Your score is 400 of a possible 400” and introduces the Magrathea landing. QUIT at the post-ending prompt; the replay halts after 429 commands.",
  "intro": [
    "Start a fresh Release 31 game with deterministic seed 1003. Enter each numbered command at the prompt. Repeated waits are intentional: they let the Vogon captain finish the poem, allow scene events to occur, and control the Improbability Drive’s Dark exits.",
    "The route covers Earth, the Vogon ship, the Heart of Gold, Traal, Damogran, the party, the War Chamber and Maze, and the sperm whale. Keep the towel for Traal; store equipment in the thing your aunt gave you when the load is heavy.",
    "After the whale, retrieve the four fluffs and grow the plant in the sauna. Keep both tea and no tea for the screening door. The fruit reveals the correct tool: a pair of hypersonic pliers. Wear the gown and carry only the fish, no tea, and pliers into the Access Space."
  ],
